#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nooploop-tofsense-f.rst:5
#: 4b6cc4fbac21422a825284d4f40ae698
msgid "Nooploop TOFSense F/FP/F2 Mini/F2/F2 P"
msgstr "Nooploop TOFSense F/FP/F2 Mini/F2/F2 P"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nooploop-tofsense-f.rst:8
#: 2b98a9984d6b4ac99dca4238cc0b4011
msgid ""
"Support for this sensor is available in firmware versions 4.5 and later."
msgstr "固件 4.5 及更高版本支持此传感器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nooploop-tofsense-f.rst:10
#: 03d7742f33e548bbb9e59093d4863239
msgid ""
"The `TOFSense F/FP/F2 Mini/F2/F2 P "
"<https://ftp.nooploop.com/downloads/tofsense/TOFSense-"
"F_Datasheet_V2.0_en.pdf>`__ is lightweight rangefinder module that provides "
"fast and accurate distance measurements up to 50 meters (F2 P variant only)."
" ArduPilot currently supports this sensor via both UART and IIC."
msgstr ""
"`TOFSense F/FP/F2 Mini/F2/F2 P "
"<https://ftp.nooploop.com/downloads/tofsense/TOFSense-"
"F_Datasheet_V2.0_en.pdf>`__ 是一款轻量测距模块，可实现最远 50m 的快速精准测距（仅 F2 P 型号）。ArduPilot"
" 目前支持通过 UART 和 IIC 两种方式连接该传感器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nooploop-tofsense-f.rst:16
#: 02ba7ea6323d439c93b8a0663e2d2a82
msgid "Connecting via UART to Autopilot"
msgstr "通过 UART 连接至飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nooploop-tofsense-f.rst:18
#: 335eb3493fb24410b78eee45bfc0bb3a
msgid ""
"The same steps as the Nooploop TOFSense P (UART) can be followed, as linked "
":ref:`here <common-rangefinder-nooploop-tofsense-p>`. :ref:`RNGFND1_MAX "
"<RNGFND1_MAX>` can be changed as per the sensor specifications (15 for "
"TOFSense F and 25 for TOFSense FP)"
msgstr ""
"可参照 Nooploop TOFSense P（UART）的步骤进行操作，链接见 :ref:`此处 <common-rangefinder-"
"nooploop-tofsense-p>`。可根据传感器规格调整 :ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` （TOFSense "
"F 为 15，TOFSense FP 为 25）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nooploop-tofsense-f.rst:22
#: 8d53334ae682482194a61d735ba04cd4
msgid "Connecting via I2C"
msgstr "通过 I2C 连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nooploop-tofsense-f.rst:23
#: 39ff5d51f6d74cb88f8185076ce052ca
msgid ""
"Setup the sensor through the NAssistant Software provided by the "
"manufacturer. More details can be found `here "
"<https://www.nooploop.com/download/>`__. For I2C mode, in the setup screen "
"set \"Interface\" to I2C. You can also set the \"ID\" to a unique number if "
"planning to use multiple TOFSenseF. The I2C adress of the sensor is linked "
"to the ID set in the NAssistant software. The default address is 0x08 for ID"
" 0 (or 8 in decimal; i.e the parameter you will set in the GCS), 0x09 (or 9)"
" for ID 1 and 0x10 (or 10) for ID 2. The address can be calculated as 0x08 +"
" ID. For example, if the ID is set to 2, the address will be 0x0A (or 10)."
msgstr ""
"通过制造商提供的 NAssistant 软件配置传感器，详情可在 `此处 <https://www.nooploop.com/download/>`__"
" 获取。对于 I2C 模式，在设置界面将「Interface」设为 I2C。若计划使用多个 TOFSenseF，可将「ID」设置为唯一编号。传感器的 "
"I2C 地址与 NAssistant 中设置的 ID 对应。默认地址为：ID 0 对应 0x08（即十进制 8，也是您在地面站中设置的参数值），ID 1"
" 对应 0x09（即 9），ID 2 对应 0x10（即 10）。地址计算公式为 0x08 + ID。例如，ID 设为 2 时，地址为 0x0A（即 "
"10）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nooploop-tofsense-f.rst:30
#: 18e47280a5f145babb68671e1ef0ee27
msgid ""
"The 4 Pin JST-GH connector wiring of the sensor does not match with the I2C "
"2 port wiring of most autopilots (For example, Cube Orange). Wiring "
"incorrectly can lead to damaged sensor and/or autopilot."
msgstr ""
"传感器的 4 针 JST-GH 连接器接线与大多数飞控（例如 Cube Orange）的 I2C 2 "
"接口接线不匹配。接线错误可能导致传感器和/或飞控损坏。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nooploop-tofsense-f.rst:32
#: d19594228e6941f0b471a2bd4f41ce56
msgid "For a I2C connection you can use any spare I2C port."
msgstr "I2C 连接可使用任意空闲 I2C 接口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nooploop-tofsense-f.rst:37
#: 0ebc48932e2d4d4ea4abb8948c6322fd
msgid "Set the following parameters"
msgstr "设置以下参数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nooploop-tofsense-f.rst:39
#: d6e7e60850174393988374fc9982cd81
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 40 (NoopLoop_TOFSenseF_I2C) Reboot "
"after setting this."
msgstr ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 40（NoopLoop_TOFSenseF_I2C），设置后重启。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nooploop-tofsense-f.rst:40
#: 702a21217f6c40bab2ef8cde008ff774
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_ADDR <RNGFND1_ADDR>` = I2C slave address of the sensor "
"(Default is 8, which corresponds to ID 0 in the NAssistant software)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_ADDR <RNGFND1_ADDR>` = 传感器的 I2C 从地址（默认为 8，对应 NAssistant 软件中的 "
"ID 0）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nooploop-tofsense-f.rst:44
#: 58999f722504404f91f052672fb23042
msgid "Testing the sensor"
msgstr "测试传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nooploop-tofsense-f.rst:46
#: 0b19c85d5468488fabbd703055a2709c
msgid ""
"Distances read by the sensor can be seen in the Mission Planner's Flight "
"Data screen's Status tab. Look for \"rangefinder1\"."
msgstr "传感器读取的距离值可在 Mission Planner 飞行数据页面的「状态」选项卡中查看，请留意「rangefinder1」项。"
